"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Brennan, Marshall, Sotomayor</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"440\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Common-law reasoning</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"500\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\"Living Constitution\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"620\" width=\"940\" height=\"400\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Document Itself</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Preamble + 7 Articles + 27 Amendments</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Art. I: Congress  |  Art. II: President  |  Art. III: Courts</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Art. IV: States  |  Art. V: Amendment  |  Art. VI: Supremacy</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"white\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Art. VII: Ratification</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bill of Rights (1-10) ratified 1791</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Reconstruction Amendments (13, 14, 15) — 1865-1870</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"990\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Most recent: 27th Amendment (1992)</text></svg>",
